{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫劇集《非份之罪》14日播出的單元《一億殺機》高潮迭起！其中徐榮（飾演宏智）因情緒失控而狂撼頭埋枱的一幕，絕對是全集最搶眼的焦點所在，其極具張力的演出令觀眾睇得相當肉緊。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇情講述警方掌握愈來愈多罪證，將悅萍（陳煒飾）及宏智帶返警署協助調查。由於兩人被安排分開錄取口供，宏智頓時陷入情緒崩潰，一邊大叫「我要搵我老婆」，一邊瘋狂拍打桌面。隨後他的情緒愈發激動，更失控地不斷將頭狂撼向枱面，最終跌倒在地全身抽搐，更按着心口疑似心臟病發，情況危急需緊急送往醫院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5e7bcac1-3e6a-4330-928b-cff6b6821306.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026lu9tglqb7O1784084058.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5e7bcac1-3e6a-4330-928b-cff6b6821306.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"efb93ab3-1a8b-43f8-8fab-53ec2220957e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026CfvJqW3muR1784084062.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"efb93ab3-1a8b-43f8-8fab-53ec2220957e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">及後，悅萍在警方陪同下趕赴醫院，原本情緒激動的宏智在看見太太後，才慢慢冷靜下來並緊緊相擁。然而，他卻突然向警方自首，承認自己就是殺死紹聰（施焯日飾）的真兇！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">徐榮在警署這場撼頭埋枱的戲份發揮得淋漓盡致，完美展現出角色的恐懼與激動。他接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a>獨家訪問時直言，拍攝當刻已經完全進入角色狀態，因此撞擊力度非常大：「拍咗幾Take，拍完個額頭都腫咗，到依家都仍然腫起咗，但係為咗場戲係值得。」</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">徐榮這次細膩又搏命的演出，贏得大批網民擊節讚賞，紛紛認為該角色絕對「唔易做」，並留言熱議後續劇情：「佢做得好好！」「咁撞唔腫就奇！」「徐榮呢次演出有突破。」「佢係咪為咗老婆頂罪呀？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T08:20:06.549101+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":523,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}